window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>He’s called a monster, a beast, a dragon, and he’s chosen me. I think I’m in trouble. Again.</p> <p>Yeah, alien abduction is for suckers. If I thought my life was bad before I woke up in the alien prison, it’s just about to get a whole load worse, because I’ve been rescued by an alien warrior who is much better at stripping flesh from bone than being a hero.</p> <p>Draxx has glowing green scales, endless muscles, huge claws and very often, a tail. He also prefers not to wear pants. He has cheekbones I could cut myself on and a set of lips which are very good at kissing.</p> <p>Ask me how I know…</p> <p>I’m on a personal mission. Not only am I not going to let alien abduction beat me, I’m going to find the other humans I heard in my part of the prison and free them. Nothing’s going to stand in my way.</p> <p>Not even the big green scaled alien warrior with a domination streak, dirty talk and burning desire to make me his mate. If he doesn’t get out of my way, I won’t be responsible for what happens next.</p> <p>The problem is, I think it’s going to be him stealing my heart.</p> <p>The Fated Mates of the Sarkarnii series continues with DRAXX, a warrior with a huge heart who doesn't believe he deserves love and a human who has had her heart crushed one too many times. Spicy, delicious and with always a HEA.</p>"; 
